  "rules": [
    "Always spell it devShark: one capital S, also in uppercase labels. Never DevShark or DEVSHARK.",
    "The fin sits left of the name, its tip pointing left, with one wave and a transparent cut-out.",
    "Green on white or light grounds, white on ink or green, ink for one-colour print.",
    "Clear space on every side equals the height of the letter d.",
    "Below 100 px of width, use the clean fin instead of a logo.",
    "The favicon and embroidery use the clean fin only. Every fin apart from the logo's is the clean fin.",
    "Never trace, redraw or recolour a mark; every file draws the name as outlines.",
    "Text contrast reaches 4.5:1: white on ink or green, ink on pale. Green text never sits on ink (3.15:1).",
    "devShark ships no AI feature. Brand copy makes no AI claims."
  ],
  "doNots": [
    "Do not use gradients.",
    "Do not add shadows.",
    "Do not add 3D effects.",
    "Do not use the V1-V10 working variants in production.",
    "Do not put generated imagery on the marks.",
    "Do not fake terminals or screenshot made-up UI."
  ],
  "socialRules": [
    "A carousel is 5 slides at 1080 × 1350: the question, context or code, the options, the answer and why, the takeaway.",
    "Slide grounds run Ink #132019, Pale #f3f6f1, Green #2d7a2d, Pale, Ink; white text on ink and green, ink on pale.",
    "The clean fin sits 48 px wide in the same corner of every slide, 48 px from the edges: white on ink and green, green on pale.",
    "The full logo appears only on the last slide: the horizontal logo, 160 px wide or more.",
    "devShark is named once, on the last slide. Slides 1 to 4 teach; they do not sell.",
    "Code is set in JetBrains Mono on a pale or ink panel.",
    "A square post is 1080 × 1080: one fact, question or result, the clean fin in the corner at 48 px, and the compact or horizontal logo at the bottom when it names devShark.",
    "A story is 1080 × 1920 with text and marks inside the middle 1080 × 1420; the clean fin sits at 48 px in the top corner of that safe area.",
    "The owner's social SKILL.md will replace these interim rules (docs/marketing/social-skill.md)."
  ],
  "typography": [
    "The name is drawn as outlines in every logo file; do not set it in a font. The lettering started as Manrope ExtraBold.",
    "Manrope 800 and 700 for headings and display.",
    "Inter 400 and 500 for body text and interface.",
    "JetBrains Mono 400 for code in marketing and print."
  ],
